arcint (0.2.10-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Second-model review fixes: the USM-host index-tensor map is pruned per
    request (slow host-memory pin under ARCINT_PA_HOST_INPUTS), embed_take
    verifies the embeddings output byte-for-byte, the MTP head argmax guards
    an empty output, and a load-time tripwire refuses an export whose
    value_cache pages are not the assumed 16 tokens.
  * ARCINT_PA_HOST_INPUTS (experiment, default off): paged index inputs as
    USM-host tensors; the measured control for the M=2 host-cost attribution.
  * patches/0003 documents the GPU plugin's per-infer MoE subbuffer churn at
    token_num > 1 (the --mtp on loss; fix is plugin-side, not in this package).

