arcint (0.2.8-1) trixie; urgency=high

  * reasoning_content. Qwen3.6's template opens the think block in the prompt,
    so the model's output begins with its reasoning and a bare </think>;
    arcint returned all of it as content. Everything before the first close
    now goes to reasoning_content (deltas when streaming), content is the
